flowchart TB
  Products["Source-owned products<br/>Meaning · time · quality"] --> Analysis["Versioned analysis<br/>Evidence · alternatives"]
  Analysis --> Workspace["Decision workspace<br/>Question · trade-offs · choice"]
  Workspace --> Plan["Exact plan + separate authority<br/>Approval or permitted bounded grant"]
  Trust["Tenant trust + policy<br/>Pinned issuers · keys · roles"] --> Plan
  Plan --> Source["Source enforcement<br/>Permission · state · invariants"]
  Source --> Result["Verified outcome<br/>Source receipt · postconditions"]
  Result -. "record and review" .-> Workspace
